  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Weather Maker (https://assetstore.unity.com/packages/tools/particles-effects/weather-maker-unity-weather-system-sky-water-volumetric-clouds-a-60955) is a very performance friendly procedural weather maker for Unity, useful for creating realistic clouds and weather effects such as rain, snow and even thunderstorms with procedural lightning designed with desktop and VR in mind keeping draw calls to a minimum. (Volumetric fog and lighting is one draw call) This would greatly streamline the world creation process as we wouldn't have to mess with an inordinate amount of particle systems and animations (or one specific system for a large amount of time) to get fantastic looking weather effects, and would allow for said weather to be vastly more detailed while retaining decent performance across platforms.",
